  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The violent scene is mapped as the 'peaceful religion' being mocked",
  "description": "The text 'how dare people make fun of our peaceful religion' is juxtaposed with a scene of violent destruction (a car bombing or explosion). This creates an analogical mapping where the visual material (the wreckage and the angry man) is being used to represent or stand in for the 'peaceful religion' that is supposedly being mocked. The meme implies that the violence depicted is somehow connected to or a reaction against the 'peaceful religion', which is a dangerous and misleading framing. The visual of chaos and outrage is mapped onto the textual claim of a 'peaceful religion' being victimized.",
